  "_searchQueriesComment": "searchQueries + setQueries are concatenated and sent to each retailer's own search engine (Walmart, Amazon, Best Buy all use the identical list). Results are relevance-ranked and capped (~40 Walmart, 100 Best Buy), so a broad term alone does NOT guarantee a brand-new listing appears — that is what setQueries is for. Rotate setQueries when a set stops being the current drop; each extra query costs a request per Walmart cycle and 5 ScraperAPI credits per Amazon discovery.",
